#paragraph(style = "S26")[Five lines with widow control below 554 begins a paragraph of several lines, whose words continue far enough that the text must wrap at the right margin twice and occupy three lines in either renderer, as the measurement of the foot of a page requires. A further sentence lengthens the paragraph to five lines, so that the control of widows and orphans has a choice of places at which the paragraph may be divided between two pages of the document.]

